    <briefdescription>
<para>The values and first derivatives of the non-zero 1D B-splines at the 1D quadrature points. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The tensor product B-splines and the quadrature grid both have a tensor product structure. The value of a tensor product B-spline at a quadrature point can therefore be computed from the values of the 1D B-splines at the 1D quadrature points. The memory required to store these values is O(N_1 + N_2).</para>
<para>The B-spline index stored in the stash is the offset from the first non-zero B-spline at the quadrature point.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="templateparam"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>QDim1Mesh</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classQuadrature" kindref="compound">Quadrature</ref> mesh in the first dimension. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>QDim2Mesh</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classQuadrature" kindref="compound">Quadrature</ref> mesh in the second dimension. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BSplines1</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Splines in the first dimension. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>BSplines2</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Splines in the second dimension. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
